{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31813","headline":"雨夜同厉玄怀皇甫荀 · 贾岛","name":"雨夜同厉玄怀皇甫荀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐竹遶庭匝，雨多风更吹。\n还如旧山夜，卧听瀑泉时。\n碛鴈来期近，秋钟到梦迟。\n沟西吟苦客，中夕话兼思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}